+    // How the KV pool is sized and what it does with memory it is not using.
+    /** @brief Cells in the unified KV pool, which the lanes share. 0 reserves `ctx_size` for every lane (`ctx_size` x `lane_count`), so each lane can reach its window whatever the others hold. Any other value is the whole pool: it must hold at least one lane's `ctx_size`, and requires a unified cache. */
