+    /** @brief Whether KV cells are zeroed as the pool's high-water mark advances rather than all at creation. AUTO and TRUE zero lazily wherever the cache layout and its buffers allow; FALSE zeroes the whole pool at creation and keeps every page, as upstream does. */
